<BaseLayout title="Proof of Authorization | Daniel's Lock & Key" description="Learn what proof to prepare for authorized property and passenger-vehicle lockout entry."><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="kicker">Authorized entry</p><h1>Why Daniel asks who can approve access.</h1></div></section><section class="section shell detail"><div><h2>Prepare the right context</h2><ul><li>Government-issued identification</li><li>Proof of occupancy, ownership, tenancy, or management authority</li><li>Vehicle ownership evidence for passenger-vehicle entry</li><li>Landlord or property-management contact when required</li></ul><p>If documents are inside, explain that by phone. Verification is still required before entry service.</p></div><aside><h2>Ask Daniel about the situation</h2><a class="pill" href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>Call {site.phone}</a></aside></section></BaseLayout>
